<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT - Telmex started as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telmex started as hold.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokerage house Serfin has started coverage of Telefonos de Mexico SA de CV, S.A. (Telmex) with a hold recommendation.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We are initiating coverage with a hold recommendataion of Telefonos de Mexico since we have set a year-end targt price of 22.76 pesos which implies the stock will slightly underperform the market,&quot; Serfin said in a statement released Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Telmex is Mexico's leading provider of telephone services.</p>
<p>-- It closed on Wednesday at 20.65 pesos per share.</p>
<p>((--Robert Kozak, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 9559))</p>
